&lt;p&gt;Preserve your old photographs, home movies, records and cassettes!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How to Access&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check the &lt;a href="https://library.cityofpaloalto.org/vintage-media-lab/"&gt;Vintage Media Lab&lt;/a&gt; page. If appointments are still available for the month, click the Book@Rinconada button near the top of the page. Otherwise, check back on the first Monday of the month for another chance to sign up.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Each appointment includes a skilled volunteer or staff person to assist you. Appointments are limited to &lt;strong&gt;a single two-hour&lt;/strong&gt; appointment&nbsp;per week per person.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Because space and time in the Vintage Media Lab is limited, we appreciate your cooperation in regard to equipment, storage and cleanliness.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What to Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Laptop&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;SD Card, Memory Card&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;USB Drive, Flash Drive or Memory Stick&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;External Hard Drive&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Your Vintage Media!&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Need help with your homework? Kindergarten through 8th&nbsp;grade students can come to&nbsp;Edenvale Branch Library's Homework Club to get coached by&nbsp;trained library volunteers.&nbsp;Students can get free help with their homework in subjects such as reading, writing, math, and social studies!​&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Homework Club at Edenvale Branch Library is scheduled for &lt;strong&gt;Tuesdays each week from 4:00 PM – 6:00 PM&lt;/strong&gt;, except for the following dates because of City holidays and school breaks:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;September 29th&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;November 3rd&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;November 24th&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Homework Club will end on November 17th for the Fall Semester&nbsp;and take a break for the Winter Holidays. The schedule for the Spring&nbsp;semester will be determined and posted in December 2026.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Free.&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No registration is required; however,&nbsp;Homework Club has a limited capacity.&lt;/strong&gt; Services will be provided on a first-come, first-served basis. As a result, students might not be coached one-on-one for the whole duration of the program depending on volunteer availability.&nbsp;If we do not have enough tutors, students will be redirected to &lt;a href="https://lhh.tutor.com/default.aspx?ProgramGUID=959689ad-dbc0-4aed-88af-a9e18361ccf5&InterfaceId=1&InterfaceType=K12"&gt;Tutor.com&lt;/a&gt;, a library resource.&lt;/p&gt;
